*  MV-BLOB-GLUE GUARD: call-as-pattern whose returned pattern carries a capture.
*  GOAL-SNOBOL4-100 R-2 / R-8 witness set (s105).  Oracle: /home/claude/x64/bin/sbl -b <file>
        DEFINE('F()')                                   :(FEND)
F       F = LEN(2) . X                                  :(RETURN)
FEND
        'ABCDE' F()                                     :F(NOM)
        OUTPUT = 'MATCHED X=[' X ']'                    :(FIN)
NOM     OUTPUT = 'NOMATCH'
FIN
END
